{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_5","type":"agent_message","text":"Implemented `refund_order` and `export_credit_note`. Each partial refund records a negative ledger entry and reverses its share of tax using cumulative half-up rounding. When refunds reach the order total, they reverse the original subtotal and tax exactly.\n\nRefunds and upgrades share ledger-wide idempotency keys. Identical retries return the original entry. Conflicting retries and over-refunds raise `ValidationError`. Credit notes export the individual refund’s cent amounts as positive magnitudes.\n\nAdded five refund tests. All 21 tests passed, and `run_checks.py` exited 0."}}
